{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03953","headline":"奉和人日清晖阁宴羣臣遇雪应制 · 刘宪","name":"奉和人日清晖阁宴羣臣遇雪应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"舆辇乘人日，登临上凤京。\n风寻歌曲扬，雪向舞行萦。\n千官随兴合，万福与时幷。\n承恩长若此，微贱幸昇平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03953.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03953","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}